json\n This tool currently runs two common nonparametric rank tests: \n \n  Mann-Whitney U  \n Use for two independent groups. \n  Wilcoxon signed-rank  \n Use for paired observations with equal group lengths. This test requires the\ntwo-table input layout so observations are paired by row. \n \n Inputs may be provided as one table with a group column and a numeric value\ncolumn, or as two separate tables with one numeric value column per group.\nMissing values encoded as blank, NA, NaN, None, or null are skipped for\nindependent Mann-Whitney U tests. Wilcoxon signed-rank tests require complete\npaired observations. \n The output is a two-column tabular summary containing the selected test,\ngroup labels, sample sizes, alternative hypothesis, method, statistic, and\np-value. \n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
